<div class="text guide-styles" data-insert-ads="article" id="guide-body" lang="en-US">This guide contains all of the pre-raid best-in-slot (BiS) gear for each armor slot as a Balance Druid DPS in Mists of Pandaria Classic. All of the gear in this guide is obtainable without raiding, with a focus on Heroic and Celestial dungeon loot, gear crafted with professions, and Valor Point rewards.<br/>
<br/>
