<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Balance Druid</span></h2>This is an example of the best-in-slot gear available from all PvE sources available before entering a raid. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift.<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
<div class="tabs-wrapper exclude-units uniform-width">
<div id="dsf67g4d-bis-lists">
<div class="tabs-container">
<div class="tabs" role="tablist">
<button aria-selected="true" data-first-in-row="true" data-href="#bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" data-selected="true" role="tab" tabindex="0">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/achievement_jadeserpent.jpg");'></span>Pre-Raid Opening</div></button>
<button data-first-in-row="false" data-href="#bis-lists-msv-release" role="tab" tabindex="-1">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></span>MSV Release</div></button>
<button data-first-in-row="false" data-href="#bis-lists-hof-release" role="tab" tabindex="-1">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendary_breathofblackprince_agi.jpg");'></span>HoF Release</div></button>
<button data-first-in-row="false" data-href="#bis-lists-toes-release" role="tab" tabindex="-1">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendary_chimeraoffear.jpg");'></span>ToES Release</div></button>
<div class="vertical-scroll-shadow"></div>
<div class="horizontal-scroll-shadow"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic prior to Mogu'Shan Vaults opening and Celestial Dungeons becoming available. Keep in mind you won't be able to get <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=74724/enchant-weapon-jade-spirit">
<img alt="Enchant Weapon - Jade Spirit" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Jade Spirit</span></a> or <a class="q1 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=74703/enchant-bracer-super-intellect">
<img alt="Enchant Bracer - Super Intellect" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Super Intellect</span></a> for this set. Some of these items are expensive, if they're outside your budget, it is recommended to check the Heroic Dungeon Gear section for alternatives.<br/>
<br/>
